  "evidence": "Main add callback 0xc600de4 navigates to add-list page on code 7. City callback 0xc600d04 passes its user data to page 2. Add-list callback 0xc600a10 reads city count before event dispatch, reads a city pointer on code 7, and calls the add routine; it displays an upper-limit hint at count 20. Detail callback 0xc5ffae0 reads a city pointer and calls the removal routine on code 7. Main row creation and update register the same callback. Time and offset helpers are called from both row creation and update.",
